# Threading and Dispatch

Coming soon — this page explains Reactor's threading model: UI-thread
invariants, trampoline dispatch, batched renders, how a background-
thread `setState` gets marshaled, why `UseEffect` callbacks run on
the UI thread, and the off-thread work patterns Reactor supports.
See [the AI Author Skill](../../_pipeline/ai-author-skill.md) for the
planned surface.

Until then, [Effects](effects.md) covers the surface async patterns.
